  "subject": "A village matchmaker tells the groom's family that the girl eats very little and the girl's family that the boy hardly talks, then at the first meeting he talks nonstop and she eats nonstop and they suit perfectly.",
  "caption": "Taiwanese gua-a-tiau opera-folk song, brisk lilting two-beat storytelling tune. Plucked yueqin moon guitar carrying the rhythm, kokiu two-string fiddle doubling the melody with slides, bamboo flute ornaments between lines, wooden clappers and a small gong marking the phrase ends. Dry live stage-room sound. Female vocal, bright forward mid-high register, teasing storyteller delivery, clearly sung melody. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 96 BPM, D major. Playful, brisk, cheeky mood. No drum kit, no electric guitar, no synth, no autotune, no rap.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n媒人婆我，行佇巷仔內\n兩爿的門，我攏敲過\n對查埔厝講，彼个查某囡仔食真少\n對查某厝講，彼个後生話真少\n[Pre-Chorus]\n紅紙包一包，喙齒笑咧咧\n兩頭哄甲甜，無人知影\n[Chorus]\n媒人喙，糊瘰瘰\n講甲兩爿攏歡喜\n食少話少攏無要緊\n見面才知，啥人較濟\n[Verse]\n見面彼日坐桌邊\n伊的飯碗，添三擺\n伊的喙仔講袂停\n我的茶杯，閣倒一杯\n[Pre-Chorus]\n查埔厝的阿母，目睭金金\n查某厝的阿爸，筷仔停落\n[Chorus]\n媒人喙，糊瘰瘰\n講甲兩爿攏歡喜\n一个愛食一个愛講\n恰好湊作堆\n[Verse]\n兩爿的大人，共我罵\n騙人，騙人，你這个媒人\n我講恁看，伊食伊講\n一个講，一个食，一世人袂無聊\n[Bridge]\n一个講，一个食\n我的紅包，加一擔\n[Chorus]\n媒人喙，糊瘰瘰\n講甲兩爿攏歡喜\n食濟話濟攏無要緊\n恁看，相配無\n[Outro]\n紅包交予我，明仔載閣來\n下一對，我欲講兩種話",
